=== For formatter

i.)with website

1.copy xml code
2.search "online formatter" or "xml beatifier" in chrome
3. paste the code and click "format" or "beatify"
4. copy the code in chrome and paste in .xml file

 ====    Important: keep the top lines  === 
after format in online check this line are present or not if not add it in the top

<?xml version="1.0"?>
<?xml-stylesheet type="text/xsl" href="course.xsl"?>
<!DOCTYPE course SYSTEM "course.dtd">

ii.)without website

 install  Red Hat XML extension 
 open course.xml and press "Shift + Alt + F".

 